OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FMostly dry
OL,6,Fwith clear spells at first allowing
OL,7,Ffor an early frost. Turning cloudier
OL,8,Fthrough the evening and overnight with
OL,9,Fa few showers from the east.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTuesday:FRather cloudy throughout the
OL,12,Fday with some showers in the morning,
OL,13,Fturning to more persistent rain and
OL,14,Fhill snow through the day. Breezy
OL,15,Faround the coast with fresh easterly
OL,16,Fwinds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
